 6. 🚲 America&#x27;s biking cities 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data : StreetLight. Graphic: Jim Sergent/Axios The average American biked 23 miles in 2024, according to research from StreetLight, a transportation data firm. 

 Biking hotspots span the country — with top-five cities on both coasts, in the Mountain West and the South. Explore the data . 

 
 
